# Provider output produced by running AI Config against an example repository
# during manual development. Only the canonical `.ai/` sources are checked in.
# Anchored to `examples/` on purpose: the same names at the repository root are
# this project's own configuration and must stay tracked.
/examples/*/.ai/.generated.json
/examples/*/.agents/
/examples/*/.claude/
/examples/*/.codex/
/examples/*/.github/
/examples/*/.opencode/
/examples/*/AGENTS.md
